WEBVTT

00:00:12.042 --> 00:00:17.000
The specimens we collected on Vega
were once again of poor quality.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.875
During the space and time transit,
all the Rare Iguras deteriorated.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:23.708
They have lost their primary function.

00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:29.875
Our mother planet Altair...

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:33.417
So she refuses to accept them
to the very end, huh...?

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:37.333
Curse...

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:40.583
We'll undertake a full-scale
reconnaissance-in-force on Vega.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.958
Jin, you take the command.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:47.708
Me? Fine by me, but I think
Kagura will probably complain.

00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:49.250
I'll shut him up,

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:55.042
as the Mechanical Angel's true power
has awakened because of him.

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:09.917
<i>Osore!</i>

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:14.000
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.625
<i>Kimi o dakishimeru</i>
<i>nando mo nando mo nando mo</i>

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:25.458
<i>Ashita boku wa kimi ni deau darou</i>

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:31.167
<i>Wazuka na hoshi akari o tayori ni</i>

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:37.250
<i>Boku ni wa kimi ga wakaru yo wakaru yo</i>

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:47.167
<i>Sen oku no toki o koe </i>
<i>futari hiraku densetsu no tobira</i>

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:53.083
<i>Naraku no ao tobikoete</i>

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:58.875
<i>Kimi to hai ni naru tame</i>

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:09.792
<i>Nagaki rinne o</i>
<i>kanashimi tsurete tabi shite kitanda</i>

00:02:09.792 --> 00:02:12.833
<i>Zenryoku de mikansei</i>

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:15.708
<i>Kimi no tonari de</i>

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:21.500
<i>Kawaita kokoro hodoke chi o nagasu kedo</i>

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.542
<i>Soba ni iru yo zutto</i>

00:02:24.542 --> 00:02:27.417
<i>Yorisotte zutto</i>

00:02:27.417 --> 00:02:32.083
<i>Futari hikari no fune ni noru</i>

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:37.917
<i>Kaze no hajimari no oto kanadeyou (Mezame!)</i>

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:44.958
"Love Index Skyrockets"

00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:55.500
Where am I...?

00:02:58.125 --> 00:03:01.042
--Mikono!
--Nope, I'm Cayenne.

00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:04.917
Ah! You are...

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:08.958
I've been told to show
you around. Come with me.

00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:12.958
Hold on a sec! What am I
doing in a place like this?!

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:14.542
Besides, where's Mikono?!

00:03:14.542 --> 00:03:16.917
I'll briefly summarize the answers

00:03:16.917 --> 00:03:22.583
to the questions you probably have right now,
and are likely to have in the future.

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:25.750
This is the St. Angel Academy in Neo-DEAVA.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:29.125
It's an academy that trains Elements,
those who pilot Aquarias.

00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:32.000
That's the place Mikono was talking about...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.375
Those with the aptitude to be Elements
are gathered here from around the world.

00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:41.625
Our mission is to repel the Abductors,
who come from a different dimension.

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:45.250
This is the hallway. And this is the restroom.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.333
You walk too fast.

00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:48.917
This is the classroom.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.000
That's the guy. See?!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.458
The civilian who hijacked an Aquaria!

00:03:55.458 --> 00:03:57.458
Then he's got an Element power, too?

00:03:57.458 --> 00:04:00.375
He forcibly merged with a girl too, right?

00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:02.625
I envy him!

00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:05.000
This is the man of the moment.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.958
You're a civilian who piloted an Aquaria.

00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:09.417
On top of that, that Gattai was
among Vectors of both genders.

00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:12.458
You are the center of attention in Neo-DEAVA...

00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:15.750
...as is the girl who was with you.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.250
Mikono...

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:21.250
That's the Berlin Wall.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:25.292
Gattai involving both male and female
Elements is strictly forbidden.

00:04:25.292 --> 00:04:28.417
Because of that, in Neo-DEAVA,

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:31.958
men and women are separated
in everyday life, too.

00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:35.792
Mikono is currently being tested
on the other side of that Berlin Wall.

00:04:37.458 --> 00:04:39.792
--This is the cafeteria.
--Wait a sec! "Being tested"?!

00:04:39.792 --> 00:04:42.167
That's all I have to say.

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:44.833
Now, I want you to clear my questions.

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:45.833
What?

00:04:45.833 --> 00:04:48.167
What's your relationship to Mikono?!

00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:54.167
"R-Relationship..."?! We just met
yesterday, so there's nothing to...

00:04:54.167 --> 00:04:57.667
She wouldn't tag along with
a guy she had just met!

00:04:57.667 --> 00:05:02.250
Wh-What's your problem?! You talk
like you know everything about her!

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.667
Don't tell me... you're Mikono's...

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:06.833
Yeah, damn straight I am!

00:05:09.292 --> 00:05:12.250
Goodbye, my first love...

00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:18.000
Of course... there's no way a cute girl
like her wouldn't have a boyfriend.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.417
She's been a coward since her childhood.

00:05:20.417 --> 00:05:22.125
Since her childhood...?

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:25.958
Oh, so you two have been betrothed
since childhood? How romantic...

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:29.417
The Suzushiro family has produced
Element power holders for generations.

00:05:29.417 --> 00:05:31.750
I, too, have an Element power,
and so do our parents.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:34.375
I see... so you're the cream of the crop...

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:36.917
You two make a good couple.

00:05:36.917 --> 00:05:41.667
But Mikono alone... My younger
sister's power alone never appeared.

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:44.458
I see, your younger sister...

00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:45.833
Your younger sister?!

00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:47.917
Mikono, who doesn't have the power,

00:05:47.917 --> 00:05:50.458
has been much more cowardly
than others since she was a child.

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:57.167
She was so scared of Abductors that
she couldn't go outside without me.

00:05:57.167 --> 00:06:01.125
But... that time, Mikono said...

00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:04.417
It's kind of a shame to
confine ourselves at home.

00:06:04.417 --> 00:06:07.542
We should come outside and feel the sun!

00:06:07.542 --> 00:06:11.208
Mikono wouldn't get anywhere
near the Aquaria on her own.

00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:13.583
She's a coward by nature.

00:06:15.333 --> 00:06:18.250
It's true that I've just met her,

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:22.000
but I feel she's different now.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.250
What?!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:28.375
I think maybe she wants to change herself!

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:35.500
So I thought... What do you think, big brother?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.417
--You bastard!
--Hey, hey!

00:06:37.417 --> 00:06:40.667
No violence in the academy.

00:06:40.667 --> 00:06:43.958
Or I'll wind a rope around you guys.

00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:47.417
--Instructor Donar...
--Instructor?!

00:06:47.417 --> 00:06:51.625
Hey, redhead! You've got an
aptitude test this afternoon.

00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:53.667
So don't eat.

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:56.833
I have a feeling that we'll be
keeping you here at the academy

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:58.417
once we see your test results...

00:06:58.417 --> 00:07:01.000
Meaning you'll be an Element candidate.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.583
I'll be an Element candidate for an Aquaria?!

00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:05.625
It's not "Aquaria."

00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:08.250
Since you went and broke the seal...

00:07:09.542 --> 00:07:11.208
...it's "Aquarion" now.

00:07:17.792 --> 00:07:23.042
So far, we haven't seen anything
in his physical responses.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:26.292
His Element power is "gravity manipulation."

00:07:26.292 --> 00:07:31.292
When there's a sudden change in his
emotions, his body floats in the air.

00:07:37.667 --> 00:07:40.917
T-That's too much!

00:07:40.917 --> 00:07:44.500
He's the very definition of
"not down to earth," huh?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.792
But his floating power alone

00:07:46.792 --> 00:07:50.208
can't explain the destruction
of the Guize Stone.

00:07:50.208 --> 00:07:52.500
Did his power have nothing to do with it?

00:07:54.667 --> 00:07:58.875
Either way, when that strong enemy
returns and mounts an attack,

00:07:58.875 --> 00:08:01.917
we'll have no choice but to fight back
using that forbidden Aquarion.

00:08:01.917 --> 00:08:04.167
I can't agree, Headmaster.

00:08:05.167 --> 00:08:09.875
If things go wrong, that ominous
tragedy will be repeated.

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:11.375
Tragedy?

00:08:14.417 --> 00:08:17.208
E-Excuse me, what am I doing this time?

00:08:17.208 --> 00:08:21.333
Relax... and just take in whatever you see.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:27.125
He called Aquarion's true name.

00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:32.125
And in his first battle, he operated
the unknown machine Evol at will

00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:34.125
and was able to fight off the enemy.

00:08:36.375 --> 00:08:41.708
He must have memories of Aquarion
buried deep in the recesses of his mind.

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:51.125
His psycho-level has sunk to 20,000.

00:08:51.125 --> 00:08:54.542
We can see it now. The wave
changed from magenta to cyan.

00:09:00.917 --> 00:09:05.083
No! Don't go! Don't leave me here!

00:09:07.667 --> 00:09:09.792
No...

00:09:09.792 --> 00:09:12.792
No...! Don't be afraid of me!

00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:19.833
I hate it... I hate it!

00:09:23.417 --> 00:09:25.083
Don't go!

00:09:33.125 --> 00:09:35.667
This isn't good! Perform a force quit!

00:09:35.667 --> 00:09:37.125
What happened?!

00:09:37.125 --> 00:09:40.958
There's evidence that someone
interfered with his subconscious.

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:44.917
It seems it's preventing us from
performing further psychoanalysis.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.542
Someone interfered...

00:09:52.667 --> 00:09:56.417
Hey, did you hear? They said
that boys merged with a girl!

00:09:56.417 --> 00:09:58.375
Yeah! It was Zessica-<i>sempai</i>, right?!

00:09:58.375 --> 00:09:59.958
How daring!

00:10:02.792 --> 00:10:04.958
Their skirts are short!

00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:09.500
Zessica! You're amazing!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.458
To think you merged with boys... I envy you!

00:10:12.458 --> 00:10:14.667
On top of that, one of them
was Cayenne, right?!

00:10:14.667 --> 00:10:19.125
He's so stoic and cool, forever holding
the position of the Number 2 guy.

00:10:19.125 --> 00:10:21.875
I'm definitely a fan of Shrade,

00:10:21.875 --> 00:10:24.208
but he rarely participates in battle sims, so...

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:26.333
We'll be able to go home soon.

00:10:26.333 --> 00:10:28.500
They'll find out I don't have an Element power

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:31.042
as soon as they check the test results.

00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:39.375
So all the girls here have an Element power...

00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:43.042
Hey! What was it like to merge with boys?!

00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:48.167
Hmm... Compared to merging
with girls, it was... deep, maybe?

00:10:48.167 --> 00:10:50.000
So it's deep! It really is deep!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.292
I envy you! I want to merge, too!

00:10:52.292 --> 00:10:55.167
Actually, if I could see Cayenne,
that'd be enough for me!

00:10:55.167 --> 00:10:58.042
Ahh! I wish the Berlin Wall would be gone!

00:10:58.042 --> 00:10:59.542
No!

00:11:03.542 --> 00:11:07.750
The Berlin Wall protects us!
It's very important!

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.792
We absolutely need it!
It's definitely important!

00:11:10.792 --> 00:11:11.833
Class president...

00:11:11.833 --> 00:11:14.875
Mix, you're too conservative.

00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:17.333
Stop it! You're gonna give
the boys' impurity to me!

00:11:17.333 --> 00:11:19.708
--Huh?!
--What do you mean by "impurity"?!

00:11:19.708 --> 00:11:22.125
Cayenne isn't impure!

00:11:22.125 --> 00:11:23.625
You're naive!

00:11:24.792 --> 00:11:26.500
Miss Mikono Suzushiro!

00:11:27.917 --> 00:11:29.583
"Suzushiro"? Don't tell me...

00:11:29.583 --> 00:11:33.250
Is she Cayenne Suzushiro's
younger sister?! No way!

00:11:34.708 --> 00:11:39.083
Say, Mikono... Your older
brother is impure, too, right?

00:11:39.083 --> 00:11:42.417
For example, there are dirty
magazines under his bed, aren't there?

00:11:42.417 --> 00:11:46.750
I don't know... since Cayenne
and I don't live together anymore.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.208
What're you saying?!

00:11:48.208 --> 00:11:49.625
You're from the Suzushiro family.

00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:52.083
You must have an Element power, too, right?!

00:11:53.083 --> 00:11:57.167
As siblings, you two should
be on the same wavelength!

00:11:57.167 --> 00:11:58.583
Even if you live apart, you should at least--

00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:00.917
Like I said...!

00:12:00.917 --> 00:12:03.167
I don't know.

00:12:03.167 --> 00:12:06.083
I'm not like Cayenne.

00:12:06.083 --> 00:12:08.000
I'm incapable.

00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:31.583
Chance Encounter Serenade...

00:12:34.875 --> 00:12:38.000
Mikono is on the other side of that wall.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:42.458
To think that I can't even see her face
when I'm this close to her...

00:12:47.292 --> 00:12:48.792
Piano?

00:13:03.792 --> 00:13:05.542
Is it coming from over there?

00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:14.125
Who's there?!

00:13:15.333 --> 00:13:19.250
Oh, you're the new student
everyone's talking about!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:23.125
Go ahead and have some.
Rice balls you eat in a hole are the best!

00:13:23.125 --> 00:13:24.833
Th-Thanks.

00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:31.417
By the way, what's this hole?

00:13:33.167 --> 00:13:34.500
It's the path of hope!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.917
Hope?

00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:39.458
I don't quite get it, but are you
digging this tunnel all by yourself?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.750
Oh... This is it.

00:13:50.708 --> 00:13:53.500
What?! You made a hole in
the soil with your bare hands!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.542
Yep! This is my Element power.

00:13:56.542 --> 00:13:58.292
Element power...

00:13:58.292 --> 00:14:02.458
Not only soil... All physical matter holds
a weak point somewhere within it...

00:14:02.458 --> 00:14:05.500
Yeah, that's the area that
they want someone to dig into!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:11.708
My power is to find that weak point
and make that wish come true!

00:14:11.708 --> 00:14:16.083
That's right... I'm not the
only one with a power here.

00:14:17.375 --> 00:14:22.375
All right! I'll dig, dig, and dig some more,
until I reach the girls' dorm!

00:14:22.375 --> 00:14:26.250
Girls' dorm?! Are you digging
this hole in that direction?!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:31.708
Oh? What, do you wanna dig the
blessed path that leads to hope, too?!

00:14:31.708 --> 00:14:34.083
I do... maybe...

00:14:34.083 --> 00:14:37.250
To think I'd find another who shared my vision!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.417
I'm Andy W. Hall.

00:14:39.417 --> 00:14:42.583
From this moment, we are
hole-digging brothers!

00:14:42.583 --> 00:14:45.083
"H-Hole-digging brothers"?

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:47.417
All right, let's go, my brother!

00:14:51.542 --> 00:14:55.583
Mikono... I want to see Mikono!

00:15:02.875 --> 00:15:04.542
What beautiful music...

00:15:08.625 --> 00:15:11.083
Amata...

00:15:11.083 --> 00:15:13.708
You're going to stay here, right?

00:15:15.292 --> 00:15:17.625
Yeah... I'm sure you are...

00:15:18.833 --> 00:15:22.250
I thought he was the first
person who was like me,

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.625
who I could talk naturally to.

00:15:24.625 --> 00:15:27.167
But I was wrong.

00:15:27.167 --> 00:15:30.292
Amata was chosen.

00:15:30.292 --> 00:15:32.250
But...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.792
...I was...

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:41.375
All right! We've reached the other side!

00:15:41.375 --> 00:15:43.167
We did it, brother!

00:15:50.417 --> 00:15:52.458
A-Amata...?

00:15:52.458 --> 00:15:54.875
M... Mikono...

00:16:03.667 --> 00:16:06.500
No! Let me down!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:09.042
Mikono! Stop moving!
Or we'll float even higher!

00:16:09.042 --> 00:16:10.833
No...! No!

00:16:10.833 --> 00:16:13.375
Oh, no!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:24.500
To think that you even tried to
dig there... You're no ordinary guy.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.208
No... It's not like that.

00:16:29.292 --> 00:16:32.583
Amata... You're disgusting!

00:16:32.583 --> 00:16:34.083
Mikono!

00:16:39.417 --> 00:16:43.625
Well, don't feel so down.
This can happen to anyone.

00:16:43.625 --> 00:16:48.333
You got your head stuck up her skirt
and then went for a little walk in the air...

00:16:48.333 --> 00:16:50.542
Okay, so maybe that
doesn't happen very often.

00:16:52.875 --> 00:16:55.292
Oh, crap! Let's beat it, brother!

00:17:01.917 --> 00:17:05.208
Today we hold our monthly battle sim.

00:17:05.208 --> 00:17:08.250
The Elements are Andy W. Hall...

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.792
...Cayenne Suzushiro...

00:17:10.792 --> 00:17:15.458
...and... the head will be
a new student, Amata Sora.

00:17:15.458 --> 00:17:17.417
--What? Is it gonna be okay?
--It's not Shrade?

00:17:17.417 --> 00:17:19.292
When he's a new student?

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:32.083
What have I done to Mikono...?

00:17:32.083 --> 00:17:34.083
But it wasn't on purpose.

00:17:34.083 --> 00:17:37.417
I wanna apologize to her and
clear up the misunderstanding.

00:17:37.417 --> 00:17:39.917
Start the simulation!

00:17:39.917 --> 00:17:42.625
Hey! Let's merge, Amata!

00:17:49.917 --> 00:17:52.167
Amata Sora's spirit level is in a terrible state!

00:17:52.167 --> 00:17:54.250
It's nowhere near where
it needs to be for a Gattai!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.917
Hey! Merge already!

00:17:56.917 --> 00:17:58.542
Don't try to avoid it, Amata!

00:17:58.542 --> 00:18:02.708
I'm trying to be patient too,
when the truth is I wanna merge with girls!

00:18:02.708 --> 00:18:04.500
It's not like that...

00:18:09.875 --> 00:18:14.458
You bastard! If you keep
running around, we can't merge!

00:18:14.458 --> 00:18:16.208
This is terrible...!

00:18:16.208 --> 00:18:20.500
I can't believe this boy actually
broke the Guize Stone seal.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.292
Why...? Amata Sora!

00:18:25.042 --> 00:18:28.208
Dammit! This is my first entry in three months!

00:18:28.208 --> 00:18:31.917
At this rate, I won't have a chance
to advertise how cool I am!

00:18:31.917 --> 00:18:32.917
"Advertise"?

00:18:32.917 --> 00:18:35.917
Girls are also watching this battle sim!

00:18:38.375 --> 00:18:40.417
--What're they doing?!
--The head isn't good at all.

00:18:40.417 --> 00:18:42.917
--How uncool!
--Everyone, be quiet!

00:18:44.167 --> 00:18:46.500
Boys are clumsy after all.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.958
Geez, don't hold back Cayenne!

00:18:51.917 --> 00:18:53.792
Mikono's watching this!

00:18:55.167 --> 00:18:57.042
Don't just sit there!

00:18:57.042 --> 00:18:58.792
Mikono...!

00:18:58.792 --> 00:19:01.500
I want to tell her something!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:07.167
Amata Sora's spirit level is rapidly increasing!

00:19:07.167 --> 00:19:09.125
So he's finally getting serious!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:17.292
Seishin Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:19:42.958 --> 00:19:45.500
Are they now gonna launch the counterattack?

00:19:50.292 --> 00:19:53.042
Show us, Amata Sora!

00:19:53.042 --> 00:19:55.125
Show us the depths of your power!

00:19:58.875 --> 00:20:00.708
Mikono...

00:20:00.708 --> 00:20:02.625
Mikono...!

00:20:02.625 --> 00:20:05.500
Mikono!

00:20:07.917 --> 00:20:09.333
Flying power!

00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:11.208
What acceleration!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.875
--Incredible...
--Aquaria is flying?!

00:20:15.875 --> 00:20:17.375
Amata...

00:20:19.833 --> 00:20:21.458
Okay! Time to counterattack!

00:20:21.458 --> 00:20:23.750
Make it cool, Amata!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.542
Mikono! Please accept...!

00:20:31.958 --> 00:20:34.667
This is how I feel!

00:20:47.458 --> 00:20:49.750
What's that technique?!

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.792
A defensive position that
repels all sorts of attacks...?

00:20:53.792 --> 00:20:55.500
No, it's not.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.000
He's...

00:21:01.958 --> 00:21:03.458
...apologizing...!

00:21:18.375 --> 00:21:20.458
Due to Amata Sora's nonstandard action,

00:21:20.458 --> 00:21:22.208
an error occurred in the program!

00:21:22.208 --> 00:21:24.375
The simulation will be force quit!

00:21:26.458 --> 00:21:30.333
Oh?! It's over?! We haven't
done anything cool at all!

00:21:30.333 --> 00:21:33.417
You bastard! I'm coming for you later!
You'd better be prepared!

00:21:34.667 --> 00:21:39.708
I can't believe it... What a... moron!

00:21:39.708 --> 00:21:41.792
Amata Sora...

00:22:11.167 --> 00:22:13.333
Well, then...

00:22:13.333 --> 00:22:15.917
Let's make a pilgrimage
to the Holy Land, shall we?

00:22:20.542 --> 00:22:23.458
It's been two years since the
dimensional route took hold.

00:22:23.458 --> 00:22:25.792
That man will probably wake up soon.

00:22:26.792 --> 00:22:31.167
We'll move forward while that
distinguished nuisance is still sleeping.

00:22:35.208 --> 00:22:38.917
It seems that old man Izumo is serious.

00:22:38.917 --> 00:22:42.875
Why don't you wake up... Sir Mykage?

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>Kaze ni ubawareta wake janai</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>Katamichi bun no yuuki de</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>Bokura higeki o ukeireru</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>Kokoro ga koko ni atta hazu no kuudou</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>Motto boku ga ookikereba</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>Kimi o mirai o sukueta darou ka</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Taisetsu na hito o mamoru sube o</i>
<i>tatta hitotsu shika motanai</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>Sonna anata ga hagure tadayou sora</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>Anata ijou no hito ni deaenai</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>Tsuki ni aragau nagai furea</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>Hajimari mo sezu owaru monogatari</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>Kizutsukiuru yawarakasa tojikometa senritsu</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>Kanaderu hodo utau hodo</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>Kowareru hodo ni</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>Anataga koishii</i>

00:24:19.542 --> 00:24:22.542
The boys are torn. The girls are excluded.

00:24:22.542 --> 00:24:25.542
The tall, tall wall that
separates the boys and girls...

00:24:25.542 --> 00:24:28.458
Do you have courage to go over it?

00:24:28.667 --> 00:24:30.792
"Next Episode 'The Wall ~Conquer Oneself~'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:30.792 --> 00:24:33.208
"Next Episode 'The Wall ~Conquer Oneself~'"
"The Wall: Conquer Oneself."
